## Workflow (Quy trình)

### Phase 1: Assessment - Đánh giá hiện trạng

### Bước 1: Codebase Analysis - Phân tích codebase

```
1. Size Metrics:
   - Total lines of code
   - Number of files
   - Number of modules/packages
   - Code-to-test ratio

2. Complexity Metrics:
   - Cyclomatic complexity
   - Coupling (between modules)
   - Cohesion (within modules)
   - Code duplication percentage

3. Quality Metrics:
   - Test coverage percentage
   - Linting violations
   - Technical debt ratio
   - Deprecated usage count
```

